# Frontend (Vite) — optional. Copy to .env.local only if you need to override something.
# The app needs no env vars: login uses the BCB Academy unified login and the API is
# called on the same origin as the SPA (in `bun run dev`, Vite proxies /api and
# /masuk-bcb to wrangler dev on http://localhost:8787).
#
# Base URL of the API when it is NOT served on the same origin. Default: same origin.
# VITE_API_URL=
